# Per-test plusargs for irq_after_rts_a7_shadow.
#
# IRQ injection cycle MUST land precisely at the RTS retire that
# exposes the A7-shadow race.  The window is narrow (~5 cycles wide)
# and shifts with every pipeline-latency change in the LSU/cache.
# Re-tune whenever a pipeline timing change perturbs cycle counts.
#
# History:
#   - Original tuning: +ipl=160:1 (pre dcache snoop pipelining).
#   - 2026-05-20 retune to +ipl=175:1 after dcache snoop got a
#     2-cycle pipeline stage (commit e8e44d80).  The +15-cycle shift
#     matches the snoop-pipeline-stage latency reflected in cache
#     fills along the JSR/RTS path.
#
# If this test ever fails after a future pipeline change, sweep
# +ipl cycles 100..300 step 5 and pick the smallest value where the
# test PASSes for ≥3 consecutive runs.
+ipl=175:1
